| ### UK             |      |       |        |                         |                          |                                          |        |                         |                          |                                          |                                         |       |        |                         |                          |                                          |        |                         |                          |                                          |                                         |                                         |
| London             |      |       |        | 40                      | 43                       | = Sales[Q1_Web; 3] + Sales[Q1_Shop; 3]   |        | 12                      | 15                       | = Sales[Q2_Web; 3] + Sales[Q2_Shop; 3]   | = Sales[Q1_Sum; 3] + Sales[Q2_Sum; 3]   |       |        | 30                      | 33                       | = Sales[Q3_Web; 3] + Sales[Q3_Shop; 3]   |        | 42                      | 45                       | = Sales[Q4_Web; 3] + Sales[Q4_Shop; 3]   | = Sales[Q3_Sum; 3] + Sales[Q4_Sum; 3]   | = Sales[H1_Sum; 3] + Sales[H2_Sum; 3]   |
| Leeds              |      |       |        | 47                      | 10                       | = Sales[Q1_Web; 4] + Sales[Q1_Shop; 4]   |        | 19                      | 22                       | = Sales[Q2_Web; 4] + Sales[Q2_Shop; 4]   | = Sales[Q1_Sum; 4] + Sales[Q2_Sum; 4]   |       |        | 37                      | 40                       | = Sales[Q3_Web; 4] + Sales[Q3_Shop; 4]   |        | 49                      | 12                       | = Sales[Q4_Web; 4] + Sales[Q4_Shop; 4]   | = Sales[Q3_Sum; 4] + Sales[Q4_Sum; 4]   | = Sales[H1_Sum; 4] + Sales[H2_Sum; 4]   |
| ^ ### UK total     |      |       |        | = [Q1_Web; block].sum() | = [Q1_Shop; block].sum() | = [Q1_Sum; block].sum()                  |        | = [Q2_Web; block].sum() | = [Q2_Shop; block].sum() | = [Q2_Sum; block].sum()                  | = [H1_Sum; block].sum()                 |       |        | = [Q3_Web; block].sum() | = [Q3_Shop; block].sum() | = [Q3_Sum; block].sum()                  |        | = [Q4_Web; block].sum() | = [Q4_Shop; block].sum() | = [Q4_Sum; block].sum()                  | = [H2_Sum; block].sum()                 | = [FY_Sum; block].sum()                 |
